 Circuit Connections:
ESP32 to L298N:
ESP32 Pin	L298N Pin	Description
GPIO 5	IN1	Motor A control 1
GPIO 18	IN2	Motor A control 2
GPIO 19	IN3	Motor B control 1
GPIO 21	IN4	Motor B control 2
VIN	VCC	Power to L298N (from ESP32 battery input or separate supply)
GND	GND	Common ground
Motors:
Connect Motor A to OUT1 & OUT2 of L298N

Connect Motor B to OUT3 & OUT4 of L298N

Power:
Connect a 7.4V battery to the L298N 12V input and GND

Use the 5V output from L298N to power the ESP32 VIN if your motor driver has a voltage regulator (check your L298N board)

⚠️ Ensure GND is common between ESP32 and L298N

